      <data key="d2">cb-0469</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRACTURED PARTY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fractured Party refers to the state of the political party before the appointment of Ernest Leo Unterkoefler, which he faces the task of uniting."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0469</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRANSPARENCY AND ACCOUNTABILITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Transparency and Accountability are the principles that Ernest Leo Unterkoefler vows to bring to the party as its new leader."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0469</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUXILIARY BISHOP&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Auxiliary bishop is a role held by Ernest Leo Unterkoefler, indicating his position within the church hierarchy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0469</data>
    </node>
